warning[R0308] (conservative): write to `bonus` on required module `dep`
--> 7:9: written from outside the module
  = note: a module's members belong to its own file — populating or patching it from a consumer creates hidden coupling and defeats member checking
  = note: Rime treats required modules as sealed; move the state or member into the module that owns it
